      <title>Mono&#39;s new garbage collector</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>Mono devroom</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Mono&amp;#39;s new garbage collector&lt;/p&gt;      </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I will give a short overview of what a garbage collector does, why the Boehm collector is not good enough for Mono, what SGen, our new garbage collector does better, provide a few relevant details about the internals and what this means for getting the best performance out of Mono.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Also, if the audience demands it, I will juggle 5 balls.&lt;/p&gt;      </description>
      <persons>
          <person id="2071">Mark Probst</person>
      </persons>
